    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "I often feel that the times change with irregularity."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "Their means of coming up with concepts so brilliant, their methods of forming societies so diverse, it's all dizzying."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "I've lived in Kazimierz many times, and every time I leave, I end up coming back. To tell you the truth, Banshee, traces of us are still present in that land of knights."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "I must admit the place is indeed fascinating."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Logos",
        "text": "Yet you didn't have me sketch out those neon lit skyscrapers for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Logos",
        "text": "You simply... chose this ordinary village for the stage this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_624_1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "Because it's much quieter here, and it's Kazimierz as I first saw it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "Golden farmlands amid the never ending plains. It's a pity that these are probably no longer important to the Kazimierz of today."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "What do you think, how does it compare to Kazdel?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Logos",
        "text": "Kazdel is a land of ruin, but the rubble also means that there are countless possibilities beneath it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Logos",
        "text": "Our visions of Kazdel may have their differences, but we can still look forward to its next iteration."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_624_1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "And as for Kazimierz, it evolved so fast that in the blink of an eye, the Pegasi along with their morals and glory dispersed and withered away."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "And it became even sweeter, more fascinating..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "The descendants of the Elders and the Ancients accuse us Sarkaz of devouring their flesh and blood, and enslaving their souls. So they found a new method, and they did it even better than us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "They let those under their rule be fed, swallowed, turned into nourishment for their monster to continue expanding and grow."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "And all they have to pay is a promise of the pleasures of life."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "I searched for Kazimierz's rulers, intrigued by what they had created, but instead I only discovered..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "No, there was no ruler, those company spokesmen, those members of the General Chamber of Commerce, even the Adeptus Sprawiedliwi or the Grand Knight, you could not call any of them a ruler of Kazimierz."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "Inflated desire is so powerful that it can rule itself."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Logos",
        "text": "Is a simple thirst for survival enough to keep up with your search, Damazti?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Logos",
        "text": "You're more restless than I imagined, what exactly are you afraid of?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_624_1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "Of sinking, deep into the past and history."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "I just want to understand..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierzian",
        "text": "How to get along with ourselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
