            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Hey, Kal'tsit. Not lookin' so hot, hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#10$1",
            "focus": "none"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Where am I...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Why not sleep in a little longer? I need some more time to get a bomb under your pillow."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I'm guessing you're probably not in the best mood, waking up to see me, of all people. The feeling's mutual."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I'd rather die than let someone think I've been hovering over your bed, day after day with tears in my eyes, praying with all my heart and soul that you'd open your eyes."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Believe me, this is just a coincidence. I only came looking for water, and you just happened to be in my spot."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#7$1",
            "focus": "none"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Where are the Doctor and Amiya?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Wanna take a guess?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Maybe I killed them both while you were taking a lazy cat nap."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#10$1",
            "focus": "none"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Sounds like they're both fine, for now."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You have so much faith in me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
            "focus": "none"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "What's our present location?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "The outskirts of Londinium, in a safehouse of mine. The courtyard out there is packed with a whole bunch of your people right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Is this favor of mine part of your grand plan too, Kal'tsit? You can try thanking me from the bottom of your heart, and I'll consider accepting your gratitude."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#7$1",
            "focus": "none"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Ascalon and I did work out several plans, and we did consider enlisting the help of ex-Babel members for the worst-case scenarios."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I always knew you were so good at calculating everyone's usefulness\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#8$1",
            "focus": "none"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But, I have to thank you, W."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "As you requested, from the bottom of my heart."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#12$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......Oh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Did Theresis smash your head in too hard? Should I call Shining?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#12$1",
            "focus": "none"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "I...",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 20,
            "ystrength": 20,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "Ugh\u2014",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "W."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I was kidding about calling Shining, by the way. Getting a brain injury wouldn't necessarily be the worst thing for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#7$1",
            "focus": "none"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Can you... help me up? I need to get out of bed."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......Fine."
    },
