        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Water for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1#4",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Withdrawing from Londinium was an extremely risky operation. Can you tell me the current situation?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You sure you wanna ask me? Closure's busy getting those temporary barracks up now, but we could keep our distance from each other till she gets back."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I want to hear it from you. Mercenaries have a keener sense of danger."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#12$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......Fine."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Your Self-Salvation Corps got played by Manfred, hard."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "He and his little sidekick seem to have found just the right time to take you guys out. The way I see it, these poor city folk were never a match for sharp-edged blood-licking Sarkaz scum."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "And now your poor wretches are being driven out of Londinium, which honestly to me, is a good thing. It's way better than dying in some alley for nothing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "The only good news is that the dukes finally got moving. That bitch Ines tells me the Doctor and the little bunny were kidnapped by a certain duke who wants to use them to do a favor."
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "A duke...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "So a war has broken out after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Isn't it tragic? You've missed out on all sorts of excitement."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Any regrets, Kal'tsit? Seems like your gigantic brain didn't get you the results you wanted."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I've never regretted my actions."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
