    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But sometimes I feel..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "...exhausted."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Wow. So you're actually capable of such a show of emotion? I gotta grab this once-in-a-lifetime chance to take a selfie with a poor, miserable Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I won't pretend to be the type who hides in the shadows and gropes in the direction of history, although sometimes I do hope that things go my way."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I... and my past selves have tried many approaches. Some have been successful, while others in hindsight have proven to be questionable."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But I still maintain that every choice has been made with rational judgement, and was the optimal choice at the time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Hmph. Optimal, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "'Optimal...' Using such a term does make it sound like all related problems were solved."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But that's not really the case. I can only ensure that things don't turn out for the worst."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But no matter how I try, the results often prove to me that the impact an individual can make is always limited in the end."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "No matter who it is."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Even if this name, 'Kal'tsit,' and the memories she carries have been walking these lands for so long, what I can accomplish... might be called insignificant."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "W, I... I destroyed Kazdel once. The me that I was then believed that it was the only way to bring peace."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We managed to behead The Lord of Fiends then, and we were victorious, for all intents and purposes. According to our plans, we should have reclaimed the King's authority."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I had prepared all kinds of plans, and the successors were under my supervision."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But at that moment Theresa... chose to pick up the black crown."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Hey, I'm not here for a history lesson."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "But I'm awful curious, Kal'tsit. Why did you and her put Babel together anyway? What exactly do the Sarkaz mean to you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "If you're just trying to play with our lives, she... Theresa wouldn't be on your side."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We found that, in actuality, the Sarkaz aren't so different than the rest of us as we had originally thought. Not inferior to any other race, nor nobler than any other existence."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "No matter where we've come from, Originium has changed us all into a similar form, possessing the same emotions and desires."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "This land is currently in an ugly state. The Sarkaz souls whisper of being the former masters of this world, and they were slaughtered, oppressed, displaced for countless millennia."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I have seen the times of old. I was there when only Sarkaz walked on the land."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "In fact, the term 'Sarkaz' actually originates from an arrogant abbreviation of their murderers, though it has also become a rallying cry for the victims."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The difference between a Djall and Goliath is huge, and so is the stark contrast in appearance between a Cyclops and a Di\u03b1blo, but why have they all been classified as common 'Sarkaz?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "If a Vampire establishes his own country, how would it be any different from the arrogant Victoria of today? If a Nachzehrer were to rule all civilization, how would the culture be any different from those under the ice-cold rule of Ursus?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Theresa and I came to the conclusion that these conflicts ultimately lead nowhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "She dived so deep into the Lord of Fiends' memories, and realized what I had feared was indeed possible."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Our time... or rather, all time for these lands, this world, is running out."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
