        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Why are you telling me all this? Didn't I say I'm not into history?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It's precisely because you're not, W."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "History has made Vampires, Liches, Nachzehrer, Damazti, Gargoyles... made all of you into Sarkaz, but it has also bound the Sarkaz to their past."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1#4",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Kazdel shall be rebuilt, but what will it be rebuilt on?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Perhaps someone like you would have a different answer than I do, W."
    },
