    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock",
        "text": "Are you still worried about Catherine, Feist?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#11$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock",
        "text": "The wounded have settled down for the time being. That Sarkaz mercenary called W... she's really capable."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock",
        "text": "The Self-Salvation Corps are already re-organizing themselves, and I think we'll be back in Londinium in no time."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Oh yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Rockrock, did you see anyone yesterday night?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock",
        "text": "You mean like Sarkaz troops?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "No, of course not, strangers, or... I don't know actually."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock",
        "text": "What's going on?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I received a letter... it was in my suitcase this morning."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock",
        "text": "Wasn't it written by a Self-Salvation Corps soldier?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "The handwriting's really familiar to me, but no one's coming to mind."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "The letter said that Granny is in Londinium safe and sound, and I needn't worry."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "And... it also contained several addresses, not very far from here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#11$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock",
        "text": "The only person who would do such a thing, would be a certain duke."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rockrock",
        "text": "But that duke isn't a Londinier."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Don't worry, I know exactly whose side I'm stood on."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "No matter what those bigwigs think of us... we're not their pawns."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "They think the war is just a scramble for power, and that we don't have the right to make our own choices."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "The Self-Salvation Corps will show them all they're sorely mistaken."
    },
